// Wheeled City (docs/DECKS.md section 3.3). Pack Up: the city becomes a City Caravan (population,
// buildings and tiers kept; its culture lost), 1 move; it refounds on a valid site within 12 plots
// of where it packed up. A caravan defends with its garrison; taken, it is destroyed. Not in the
// capital or a holy city (their palace and holy city do not travel). Rules: `spellPackUp`,
// `spellUnpack` (crates/ffh-core/src/ffh/cards/map_rules.rs).
