  "text": {
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_WHEELED_CITY": "Wheeled City",
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_WHEELED_CITY_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]Allows the Wheeled City (building).[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Pack Up: a city with the Wheeled City (not the capital or a holy city) becomes a City Caravan that keeps its population, buildings and tiers; its culture is lost.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Unpack: the caravan refounds the city on a valid site within 12 plots of where it packed up. Taken, it is destroyed.",
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_WHEELED_CITY_PEDIA": "Halls on mithril axles, granaries on runners, a temple drawn by forty oxen. When the war turns, the city goes with its people.",
    "TXT_KEY_BUILDING_WHEELED_CITY": "Wheeled City",
    "TXT_KEY_BUILDING_WHEELED_CITY_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]Pack Up: the city (not the capital or a holy city) becomes a City Caravan that keeps its population, buildings and tiers; its culture is lost.",
